{
  "bodyHash": "cec0e716ab9e6255",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"Serilum 合集包。用心制作。将 Serilum 的模组整合在一起，方便下载！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg\" alt=\"关于合集包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>生活质量合集包（Quality of Life Bundle）</strong>是一种特殊类型的模组，它将 Serilum 的多个<strong>qol 类型</strong>模组整合到一个文件中。虽然我觉得将这些模组分组非常困难，但我尝试这样做是为了让安装变得更加容易。它使用了一种名为 JiJ（Jar in Jar）的系统。这意味着包含的模组在内部保持完全独立，同时允许像模组包一样捆绑安装。所有模组仍然拥有各自独立的配置文件，并且你会在游戏内的模组列表中看到它们。<br><br>该合集包是模组包开发的额外辅助工具，但并不能替代我个人偏好的模块化模组系统。不过，你可以通过合集包的配置文件禁用其中包含的模组。<strong>更改配置后需要重启游戏才能生效。</strong><br><br>由于 JiJ 系统的工作方式，它既兼容正常安装该模组的情况，也兼容与合集包中包含的模组同时安装的情况。这主要用于强制使用特定版本，即使不小心以这种方式重复安装了某个模组也不会造成问题。虽然这可能不是大问题，但最好只安装一次。因此，如果你决定安装此合集包，可以移除任何其他属于此合集包的模组。<br><br>我希望这个合集包对那些喜欢内容更丰富的模组的玩家有所帮助。非常感谢大家多年来一直以来的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"环境：客户端 &amp; 服务端\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAlwaysaWitherSkull</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAutomaticDoors</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBetterBeaconPlacement</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBetterConduitPlacement</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBetterSpawnerControl</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBottledAir</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCompactHelpCommand</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableConduitsPreventDrowned</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCyclePaintings</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableDismountEntity</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableEasyElytraTakeoff</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableEnchantingCommands</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableExtendedBoneMeal</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableFurnaceRecycle</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableHoeTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableInventoryTotem</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableKeepMySoilTilled</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableKelpFertilizer</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMoveBoats</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMoveMinecarts</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableNoAnimalTemptDelay</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableNoFeatherTrample</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableNutritiousMilk</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableOreHarvester</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableQuickPaths</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableQuickRightClick</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRecast</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableReplantingCrops</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRespawningShulkers</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableScaffoldingDropsNearby</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSleepSooner</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSofterHayBales</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableStackRefill</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableStickyEnchantingLapis</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSuperflatWorldNoSlimes</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSurfaceMushrooms</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableThornyBushProtection</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableTreeHarvester</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableUnderwaterEnchanting</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableVillageBellRecipe</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableWoolTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableYourItemsAreSafe</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableZombieProofDoors</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span></div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg\" alt=\"可用合集包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下 Serilum 模组合集包可供选择：</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006994\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 客户端合集包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#999\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 定制合集包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#804d4f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 扩展合集包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#bf8f6f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 生活质量合集包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006b3f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum RPG 合集包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#805a46\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 出生点合集包</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg\" alt=\"包含的模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/always-a-wither-skull\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/always-a-wither-skull.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/always-a-wither-skull\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Always a Wither Skull</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">讓凋靈骷髏在死亡時必定掉落其頭顱。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/automatic-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/automatic-doors.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/automatic-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Automatic Doors</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">自動為玩家打開周圍的門，並在可配置的延遲後關閉它們。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-beacon-placement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-beacon-placement.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-beacon-placement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Beacon Placement</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使用礦物方塊右鍵點擊信標，即可輕鬆放置信標基座。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-conduit-placement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-conduit-placement.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-conduit-placement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Conduit Placement</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">將海晶燈放在前方，使放置海晶燈的 prismarine 方塊更容易，並進行其他調整。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-spawner-control\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/better-spawner-control.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-spawner-control\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Spawner Control</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">當刷怪籠被 5 支火把包圍時，會禁用其生成生物的功能。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bottled-air\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bottled-air.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bottled-air\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bottled Air</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許玩家在水下使用空玻璃瓶呼吸，以獲得更多氧氣。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/compact-help-command\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/compact-help-command.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/compact-help-command\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Compact Help Command</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">修改 /help 命令以顯示所有信息，使其色彩豐富並支持多頁顯示。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/conduits-prevent-drowned\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/conduits-prevent-drowned.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/conduits-prevent-drowned\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Conduits Prevent Drowned</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在海晶核心效果生效期間，阻止殭屍漁夫在玩家周圍生成。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cycle-paintings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/cycle-paintings.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cycle-paintings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cycle Paintings</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">手持另一幅畫作右鍵點擊已放置的畫作，即可輕鬆循環切換。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dismount-entity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/dismount-entity.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dismount-entity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dismount Entity</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許玩家從騎乘的生物上離開或移除生物，而不會破壞它們。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-elytra-takeoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/easy-elytra-takeoff.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-elytra-takeoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Elytra Takeoff</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許在地面無需跳躍即可使用烟花簡單地起飛（適用於鞘翅/Colytra）。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-commands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/enchanting-commands.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-commands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchanting Commands</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">通過命令輕鬆創建（模組添加的）附魔物品，附魔等級可超過默認限制。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-bone-meal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/extended-bone-meal.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-bone-meal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended Bone Meal</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">擴展骨粉功能。潛行時即時生長，支持生長地獄疣+仙人掌+甘蔗及其他調整。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/furnace-recycle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/furnace-recycle.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/furnace-recycle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Furnace Recycle</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">所有含金屬的物品均可在高爐中回收，並返回原材料。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hoe-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/hoe-tweaks.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hoe-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hoe Tweaks</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">加快作物方塊的破壞速度，增加鋤頭的作用半徑，並具備解除耕地狀態的能力。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-totem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/inventory-totem.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-totem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Totem</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使不死图腾在背包中的任何位置都能發揮作用。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/keep-my-soil-tilled\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/keep-my-soil-tilled.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/keep-my-soil-tilled\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Keep My Soil Tilled</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在收穫後，保持瓜類藤蔓下方農作物的耕地狀態不恢復為泥土。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kelp-fertilizer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/kelp-fertilizer.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kelp-fertilizer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kelp Fertilizer</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">海帶藻類自然過濾海水以獲取豐富營養。海帶的作用類似於骨粉。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/move-boats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/move-boats.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/move-boats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Move Boats</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許玩家在不破壞的情況下輕鬆移動船隻。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/move-minecarts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/move-minecarts.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/move-minecarts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Move Minecarts</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許玩家在不破壞的情況下輕鬆拾取和移動礦車。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-animal-tempt-delay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/no-animal-tempt-delay.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-animal-tempt-delay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Animal Tempt Delay</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">移除嘗試用食物誘惑動物之間的冷卻時間。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-feather-trample\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/no-feather-trample.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-feather-trample\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Feather Trample</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">擁有羽毛輕盈/緩降效果時，防止耕地被踩踏。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nutritious-milk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/nutritious-milk.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nutritious-milk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nutritious Milk</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">賦予牛奶營養價值，飲用時恢復飽食度和飽食度值。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ore-harvester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/ore-harvester.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ore-harvester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ore Harvester</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">瞬間採掘整個礦脈，並在初始方塊位置掉落礦物物品。是礦脈採集器/veinminer 模組的更新替代方案。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quick-paths\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/quick-paths.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quick-paths\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quick Paths</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">設置起點和終點，瞬間生成長距離的路徑。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td