respawning-shulkers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Respawning Shulkers</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">幻翼會在死亡位置經過可配置的延遲後重生，實現殼的永續農場。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scaffolding-drops-nearby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/scaffolding-drops-nearby.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scaffolding-drops-nearby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scaffolding Drops Nearby</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">破壞腳手架方塊時，所有連接的方塊都會在該方塊位置掉落。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-sooner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/sleep-sooner.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-sooner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sleep Sooner</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">也可以更晚睡！讓玩家在不同的時間睡覺。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/softer-hay-bales\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/softer-hay-bales.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/softer-hay-bales\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Softer Hay Bales</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使乾草捆完全抵消摔落傷害，像刺客信條一樣。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stack-refill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/stack-refill.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stack-refill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stack Refill</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">當使用最後一個物品時，如果存在替代品，則自動補充玩家手中的物品。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sticky-enchanting-lapis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/sticky-enchanting-lapis.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sticky-enchanting-lapis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sticky Enchanting Lapis</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許青金石留在附魔台中，並被玩家共享。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superflat-world-no-slimes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/superflat-world-no-slimes.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superflat-world-no-slimes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Superflat World No Slimes</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在你試圖在超平坦世界中進行創作時，移除那些煩人的史萊姆。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/surface-mushrooms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/surface-mushrooms.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/surface-mushrooms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Surface Mushrooms</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">蘑菇可以在白天的表面以及任何亮度下放置。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thorny-bush-protection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/thorny-bush-protection.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thorny-bush-protection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thorny Bush Protection</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">穿著護腿的玩家穿過漿果叢時不會受到傷害。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tree-harvester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/tree-harvester.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tree-harvester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tree Harvester</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使用斧頭瞬間採伐整棵樹和巨大蘑菇。包括快速葉子腐爛和树苗放置。也適用於扭曲（地獄）樹。很快成為砍樹大師。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/underwater-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/underwater-enchanting.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/underwater-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Underwater Enchanting</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許在水下使用附魔台，並通過書架達到最大附魔等級。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-bell-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/village-bell-recipe.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-bell-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Village Bell Recipe</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使村莊鐘變成可通過配方製作的物品。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wool-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/wool-tweaks.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wool-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wool Tweaks</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">對羊毛類方塊的配方、線轉換和染色過程進行各種更改。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-items-are-safe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/your-items-are-safe.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-items-are-safe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Your Items Are Safe</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">死亡時生成一個 chest 和盔甲架，上面放置玩家的物品，作為墓碑的替代方案。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-proof-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/zombie-proof-doors.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-proof-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zombie Proof Doors</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">防止殭屍鎖定並破壞門。</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此套件，只要下載仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多不同的模組頁面上追蹤評論，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若您有任何問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
